{
  "title": "Share extension extractURL returns on first provider even when \
loadItem fails",
  "description": "`RamekinShareExtension/ShareViewController.swift:88-120` \
iterates providers but calls `return` synchronously after \
`provider.loadItem(...)` for the first provider whose registered types contain \
a URL or plainText identifier. `loadItem` is async — if that callback reports \
an error or hands back a non-URL value, the outer function has already exited \
and `completion(nil)` from the end-of-loop bail is never reached. The loop \
never tries subsequent providers. Restructure so we only `completion(...)` \
after the async load resolves, and only stop iterating once we have a URL in \
hand.",
  "status": "open",
  "priority": 3,
  "type": "task",
  "labels": [
    "ios",
    "share-extension",
  ],
  "created_at": "2026-04-17T12:00:00-07:00",
  "updated_at": "2026-04-17T12:00:00-07:00",
}
